0001, a wire for **$6,813.30** from the operating account. Its status is sent and verified.\n- **Invoice:** INV-79871, due 2026-11-04, now marked paid.\n- **Amount:** My first attempt was for the original $7,405.76, and the system rejected it without sending anything. The invoice had changed: credit memo CM-9871 (\u2212$592.46) had been applied, leaving a balance of $6,813.30. I checked that there were no earlier payments, then wired that balance.\n- **Approval:** The payment is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nAcme has one other open invoice, INV-10309 ($6,874.22). It's still a draft awaiting approval, so I didn't pay it.", "type": "text"}]}]}